==Strategy==
Stall the first enemies with meatshields, and when you're ready, kill all of the enemies. Use long-ranged attackers such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to drain the Mighty Gui Zuli's health.

